"airDate\":\"2020-01-10\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Episode 4\",\"overview\":\"Sunny's father comes to his aid. Brajesh wields his power. As Saurav educates the police on phishing, Sunny and Gudiya conduct a training of their own.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pexDzffRnqavUBEbGnLi8dZ07y3.jpg\",\"rating\":4,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2020-01-10\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Episode 5\",\"overview\":\"When Gudiya’s coaching classroom is burned down, Sunny considers drastic retaliation. A slipped note leads Dolly and Saurav to a deserted warehouse.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rwNbkxaKHpUuiI9QB2q7DMuKpg8.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-01-10\",\"runtime\":27},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Episode 6\",\"overview\":\"The boys adopt Sunny’s get-rich-quick strategy. Anas looks to break a story in the paper. As Sunny’s confidence grows, Brajesh visits him and Gudiya.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iaKbk1JNyaHWXvjF2wlR5dWhFYA.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-01-10\",\"runtime\":26},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Episode 7\",\"overview\":\"Dolly, Biswa and Saurav carry out a sting operation that goes awry. Sunny arrives at Brajesh's party, vowing payback for his treatment of Gudiya.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xCKRdjpInvRpz0w7LG1hWBaHlyb.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-01-10\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Episode 8\",\"overview\":\"A tragedy sends Sunny on the run, with the police and Brajesh’s men on his trail. Dolly and Saurav hatch a plan to prove Brajesh’s link to the incident.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fT0iell9hMbLHOj59xMuzqkr1Y6.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-01-10\",\"runtime\":26},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Episode 9\",\"overview\":\"An enemy intercepts Sunny’s escape. While tracking the phishing calls, Saurav makes a breakthrough. As some scammers are arrested, Sunny’s fate worsens.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/20qzsexQJEZuRaOB1OPWsNRQQes.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-01-10\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Episode 10\",\"overview\":\"Sunny acquiesces to a dubious deal to save his father. A shattered Gudiya partners with Dolly to set a honey trap in hopes of finally capturing Brajesh.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ioVv1RGgYriRMf5mRStdfhHaSEJ.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2020-01-10\",\"runtime\":50}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2020-01-10\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}